  "description": "Are you annoying about the blind spots in driving?\nAre you worried about the accident when towing?\nYou need this MUST have extendable towing mirrors to KEEP YOUR DRIVING IN SAFETY.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2007-2017 Toyota Tundra\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nNotes\nReplacement tow mirrors will work for vehicles with listed functions only.\nThey might not function properly if you do not have the options listed in the specifications.\nFeatures\nVehicle Fitment: Designed specifically for Toyota Tundra from 2007, 2008, 2009, 2010, 2011, 2012, 2013, 2014, 2015, 2016 and 2017.\nPower Adjustable & Heated Glass: Equipped with power glass adjustment for convenient visibility control and heated mirror function to help clear fog, frost, and ice in cold or rainy weather, improving driving safety.\nManual Folding & Telescoping Design: Features manual folding function for tight parking spaces and telescoping extension to provide a wider rear view when towing trailers, campers, or boats. Ideal for towing and hauling needs.\nIntegrated Turn Signal Light: Built-in turn signal lights increase driving visibility and help alert surrounding vehicles when changing lanes or making turns, enhancing overall road safety.\nWhat You Get & Easy Installation: Package includes driver side and passenger side towing mirrors. Designed for quick and easy installation with no major modifications required (professional installation is highly recommended)",
